+`QLinearConv` additionally supports the optional int32 bias input.
+
+### Calibrate and export an ONNX model
+
+Supply representative SafeTensors files whose tensor names match the model inputs.
+
+```sh
+rten calibrate model.onnx --sample part1.st -o part1.profile
+rten calibrate model.onnx --sample part2.st -o part2.profile
+rten calibrate model.onnx --profile part1.profile --profile part2.profile -o merged.profile
+rten quantize model.onnx --profile merged.profile --format qoperator -o int8.onnx
+rten quantize model.onnx --sample part1.st --format qdq -o qdq.onnx
